       On success, iioo__ggeetteevveennttss() returns the number of events read.  This may
       be 0, or a value less than _m_i_n___n_r, if the _t_i_m_e_o_u_t expired.  It may also
       be a nonzero value less than _m_i_n___n_r, if the call was interrupted  by  a
       signal handler.

       For the failure return, see VERSIONS.

